content: `Generate a ${firm} case drill using these exact details:

Archetype: ${template.archetype}
Business context: ${context}
Firm: ${firm}
Difficulty: ${difficulty}
Question pattern to follow: ${pattern}
${skill_target ? `Focus skill: ${skill_target} — make sure the core math tests this skill directly.` : ""}
${industry ? `Industry context: ${industry}` : ""}

Calculated variables (use these exact numbers):
${JSON.stringify(variables, null, 2)}

Final answer: ${final_answer}
Key insight for this archetype: ${template.key_insight}
Framework soundbite to adapt: ${template.framework_soundbite}

Remember: output valid JSON only. No markdown. No preamble.`,